// smithed from one steel ingot (recipes/smithing/gearcutter.json), the wearing part. 500 points
// last 50 small gears at the default CutterWearPerGear of 10 with a full oil tank. Drawn with the
// game's chisel shape in steel. The server disables it with GearCutter off.
